# What must never reach the build context.
#
# The first two are the point: .env holds every live credential, and node_modules
# holds macOS-native binaries (@node-rs/argon2, sharp) that would silently
# replace the Linux ones the image installs and fail at runtime, not at build.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
.next
.git
.claude

# Build and test output — regenerated in the image, and only slows the upload.
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Local scratch
.DS_Store
*.log
.s1session.json
.planning
